    "title": "Aurora VB Fights Past St. Paul in C1-8 Final - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago\nAurora overgame a first set loss to down St. Paul 3-1 in the C1-8 Sub District final at the Aurora Middle School Complex. The first set featured four lead changes before St. Paul prevailed. The Huskies scored six in a row midway through the second to take command. Aurora dominated the third with Hailey Hoff serving 11 straight points. The Huskies jumped to a 6-1 lead in the fourth and never trailed.\nRead full article\n1",
